  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you have no Spells/Traps in your GY: You
    can place 1 \"Superheavy Samurai\" Pendulum Monster from your Deck, except \"Superheavy
    Samurai Prodigy Wakaushi\", in your other Pendulum Zone, then Special Summon
    this card. You can only use this effect of \"Superheavy Samurai Prodigy Wakaushi\"
    once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you have no Spells/Traps in your GY:
    You can discard 1 monster; Special Summon 1 \"Superheavy Samurai\" monster from
    your hand or Deck in Defense Position, also you cannot Special Summon monsters
    for the rest of this turn, except \"Superheavy Samurai\" monsters. If this card
    is used as Synchro Material and added to your Extra Deck face-up: You can place
    this card in your Pendulum Zone. You can only use each effect of \"Superheavy
    Samurai Prodigy Wakaushi\" once per turn."
